        "author_id": 11809982,
        "target_title": "ci: key the Go cache on go.sum and .tool-versions",
        "created_at": "2026-11-16T04:22:52.787Z",
        "note": {
          "id": 4241009243,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Thanks @phikai that's good feedback. Much better to make the key change when we change go.sum :thumbsup: \n\n\n**Manual test results**\nTested the key rotation with a throwaway MR, https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/merge_requests/4435: this branch plus a comment line in `.tool-versions`.\n\n| Pipeline | `tests:unit` cache key | Restore | `tests:unit` script | Total |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| !4374 run 1: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/pipelines/3071904807 | `go-tests-unit-f0146c3f…-3-protected` | miss (new key) | 709s | cold |\n| !4374 run 2: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/pipelines/3071947829 | `go-tests-unit-f0146c3f…-3-protected` | hit, 53s | 70s | 8m41s |\n| !4435: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/pipelines/3071908084 | `go-tests-unit-85b9a671…-3-protected` | miss (new key) | 684s | cold |\n\n- The key resolves to the per-job prefix plus the `go.sum`/`.tool-versions` hash.\n- A `.tool-versions` change rotates to a fresh key without touching this branch's cache.\n- A second pipeline on the same key restores it warm: `tests:unit` about 2m50s including cache handling, against 13m16s on the old 29 GB cache (https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/pipelines/3051676135, 18m46s total).\n- Saves take 20–46s, against 5–6 min with the old cache.",
          "author": {
            "id": 11809982,
            "username": "jay_mccure",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jay McCure",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
