        "note": {
          "id": 4241006472,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I finished my review and found nothing to comment on. Nice work! :tada:\n\n- The `key:files` cache setup with a `$CI_JOB_NAME_SLUG` prefix is valid syntax and keeps one cache per job.\n- Both key files, `go.sum` and `.tool-versions`, exist at the repo root, so the cache key resolves.\n- The golangci-lint image tag and `GO_VERSION` still match `.tool-versions`, so the tool-version rule is not triggered.",
